{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X对人物心理因果的交代比较省略，尤其想找回亲近却不愿回去受委屈的矛盾，Y解释得更连贯、更容易理解。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，X的重点加亮、短句分层和感受按音乐时点出现，让我更容易迅速抓住每段在讲什么，也更容易感受到音乐情绪的细微变化。Y的长句虽然读起来更完整，但心理因果和前后转折交代得更充分，尤其人物为什么既怀念亲近又不愿回去，理解起来更顺。总体我更愿意看X，因为它在实际观看时更容易扫读，也更能让具体的音乐感受进入耳朵和脑海。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "15071b2a-71dc-418b-a807-05821b9fca61", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T052029893732Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:21:18.360926+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "98f21eb899e53d2e9cf94f5a486a35624a51a9414a4eb8db444b524f5df4c6c9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":